The non-negotiables (Modules 6–10)
MODULE 6: selection = variation + competition + survival + inheritance; populations evolve; homologous (same build) vs analogous (same job); speciation = isolation → divergence → sterility. MODULE 7: arrows = energy flow; 10% transfers (respiration first); carbon in by photosynthesis, out by respiration/decay/combustion; nitrogen via Rhizobium → Nitrosomonas/Nitrobacter → plants → decay → denitrifiers; eutrophication chain; relationships scored +/−. MODULE 8: gut order + enzymes (amylase/pepsin/trypsin/lipase, bile emulsifies); heart trace (right=pulmonary, left=systemic, left ventricle thickest); breathe in = ribs up, diaphragm flat; aerobic ~30 ATP vs anaerobic ~2 + debt; insulin down/glucagon up; reflex arc five stations. MODULE 9: photosynthesis equation + five leaf adaptations + limiting factors; xylem up (transpiration pull), phloem any direction; germination = water + oxygen + warmth (no light). MODULE 10: microscope drill (low→high, fine-only); drawing rules (large, pencil, no shade, ruled labels); safety (goggles, water baths, report all); design (one IV, repeats, controls).$wdthseed$, NULL, 40, 2, TRUE, TRUE, $wdthseed${"objectives":["Recite selection steps, cycles and circulation traces","Reproduce photosynthesis/respiration equations","State microscope drill and fair-test rules"],"introduction":"The second half of the course, same deal: retrieve first, read second. Ten modules down — finish the sweep.","key_points":["Retrieve-then-read discipline","Synoptic linking habit","Teach-back as mastery test"],"references":["OpenStax Biology 2e — Chapters 18–44 selected (Modules 6–10 review)"]}$wdthseed$::jsonb, (select id from public.course_modules where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod11$wdthseed$), (select id from public.course_topics where seed_key = $wdthseed$biology:mod11:top01$wdthseed$), (select id from public.courses where slug = $wdthseed$biology$wdthseed$)) on conflict (seed_key) where seed_key is not null do update set title = excluded.title, descript